      en: ["The volcanic field covers an area of roughly 5,000 square kilometers.", "There are nearly 700 individual volcanic vents identified in the area.", "The most recent eruptions took place approximately 3,000 to 5,000 years ago.", "The highest elevation in the Meidob field is about 2,000 meters.", "It is geologically part of the Darfur Volcanic Province system.", "Some lava flows in the region extend for over 40 kilometers in length."],
